  "ja405:1.1": "Dvāsattati Gotama puññakammā ",
  "ja405:1.2": "Vasavattino jātijaraṃ atītā, ",
  "ja405:1.3": "ayam antimā vedagū Brahmapatti, ",
  "ja405:1.4": "asmābhijappanti janā anekāti. Appaṃ ",
  "ja405:2.1": "hi etaṃ na hi dīgham āyu ",
  "ja405:2.2": "yan tvaṃ Baka maññasi dīgham āyu, ",
  "ja405:2.3": "sataṃ sahassānaṃ nirabbudānaṃ ",
  "ja405:2.4": "āyuṃ pajānāmi tavāhaṃ Brahmeti. ",
  "ja405:3.1": "Anantadassī Bhagavāham asmi ",
  "ja405:3.2": "jātijaraṃ sokam upātivatto, ",
  "ja405:3.3": "kiṃ me purāṇaṃ vatasīlavantaṃ, ",
  "ja405:3.4": "ācikkha me taṃ yam ahaṃ vijaññanti. ",
  "ja405:4.1": "Yaṃ tvaṃ apāyesi bahū manusse ",
  "ja405:4.2": "pipāsite ghammani samparete ",
  "ja405:4.3": "taṃ te purāṇaṃ vatasīlavantaṃ ",
  "ja405:4.4": "suttappabuddho va anussarāmi. ",
  "ja405:5.1": "Yaṃ Eṇikūlasmiṃ janaṃ gahītaṃ ",
  "ja405:5.2": "amocayī gayhaka niyyamānaṃ ",
  "ja405:5.3": "taṃ te purāṇaṃ vatasīlavantaṃ ",
  "ja405:5.4": "suttappabuddho va anussarāmi. ",
  "ja405:6.1": "Gaṅgāya sotasmiṃ gahītanāvaṃ ",
  "ja405:6.2": "luddhena nāgena manussakamyā ",
  "ja405:6.3": "amocayittha balasā pasayha, ",
  "ja405:6.4": "taṃ te purāṇaṃ vatasīlavantaṃ ",
  "ja405:6.5": "suttappabuddho va anussarāmi. ",
  "ja405:7.1": "Kappo ca te baddhacaro ahosiṃ, ",
  "ja405:7.2": "sambuddhivantaṃ vatinam amaññaṃ, ",
  "ja405:7.3": "taṃ te purāṇaṃ vatasīlavantaṃ ",
  "ja405:7.4": "suttappabuddho va anussarāmīti. ",
  "ja405:8.1": "Addhā pajānāsi mam' etam āyuṃ, ",
  "ja405:8.2": "aññam pi jānāsi, tathā hi Buddho, ",
  "ja405:8.3": "tathā hi t' āyaṃ jalitānubhāvo ",
  "ja405:8.4": "obhāsayaṃ tiṭṭhati Brahmalokanti. ",
